      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>CAELNOR — level 3 PC pregen, Aelrathil sun-elf lightweaver, slave escapee. Light-starved by captivity; one flare of the sun-gift left.</p><p><strong>Drag from compendium (2024 PHB / SRD spells):</strong> Sacred Flame, Light, Guiding Bolt (2× 1st-level slots), Healing Word.</p><p><strong>Manual:</strong> Fey Ancestry — advantage on saves vs. being charmed, magic can't put him to sleep.</p>"
      }
    }
  },
